.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Nothing private, generated or heavyweight belongs in this repository:
# no model weights (*.gguf, *.safetensors, *.bin), no Ollama Modelfiles or
# blobs, no datasets or prompt corpora, no exported user diagrams, and no
# .env files. This app has no API keys and no cloud credentials by design —
# if you find yourself adding a secret, the change is wrong, not the ignore
# list.
*.gguf
*.safetensors
.env
.env.*
